__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_TERMS_OF_SERVICE",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_PRIVACY_POLICY",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_DISCLAIMER",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}});const t="STAYTUP \u2014 TERMS OF SERVICE\n\nLast Updated: September 12, 2026 (September 2026)\n\n1. ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS\nBy accessing, installing, browsing, or using Staytup (\"the App\", \"the Service\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\"), you (\"User\") acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be legally bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\") and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these Terms, you must immediately discontinue using Staytup.\n\n2. PERSONAL & EDUCATIONAL PURPOSE ONLY\nStaytup is developed for personal and educational music streaming purposes. All audio copyrights belong to their respective artists and record labels. The Service is an open experimental demonstration designed to showcase modern web audio technologies, collaborative listening architectures, and progressive web app capabilities.\n\n3. INTERMEDIARY STATUS & CONTENT AGGREGATION\nStaytup operates strictly as an independent, client-side technical search, discovery, and streaming aggregator:\n\u2022 We DO NOT host, store, reproduce, broadcast, or distribute proprietary audio or video recordings on our servers.\n\u2022 Playback streams, track metadata, and album artwork are queried dynamically and delivered on-demand from publicly accessible third-party APIs and content networks (including YouTube and public metadata directories).\n\u2022 Your interaction with third-party content is governed by the respective terms of service of the originating provider (e.g., YouTube Terms of Service and Google Privacy Policy). Staytup is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Google, YouTube, Spotify, Apple, or any media conglomerate.\n\n4. COPYRIGHT NOTICE & DMCA TAKEDOWN PROCEDURE\nStaytup respects the intellectual property rights of others and strictly complies with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) and international copyright standards.\nIf you are a copyright holder or an authorized agent and believe that content made accessible through the App infringes upon your copyright, please submit a formal notification to our designated agent:\nEmail: info.to.animikh@gmail.com\nYour notice must include:\n(a) Identification of the copyrighted work claimed to have been infringed;\n(b) The specific track title, artist, or URL reference within Staytup;\n(c) Your contact information (name, address, telephone number, and email);\n(d) A statement of good faith belief that the disputed use is unauthorized;\n(e) A statement made under penalty of perjury that the information provided is accurate and that you are authorized to act on behalf of the copyright owner.\nUpon receipt of a valid notice, we will expeditiously remove, unlink, or disable access to the infringing reference or metadata within 24 to 48 hours.\n\n5. ACCEPTABLE USER CONDUCT\nYou agree to use Staytup solely for your own lawful, private, personal listening and educational exploration. You strictly agree NOT to:\n\u2022 Use the App for any commercial purpose, public broadcast, fee-charging service, or resale;\n\u2022 Attempt to circumvent, decrypt, or tamper with any digital rights management (DRM) or security mechanisms;\n\u2022 Deploy automated crawlers, bots, scrapers, or scripts to harvest data or overwhelm network infrastructure;\n\u2022 Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the application source code beyond permitted open-source boundaries;\n\u2022 Transmit malicious code, viruses, or disruptive payloads;\n\u2022 Use the Service in violation of any applicable local, national, or international laws.\n\n6. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES (\"AS IS\")\nTHE SERVICE IS PROVIDED STRICTLY ON AN \"AS IS\" AND \"AS AVAILABLE\" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS, IMPLIED, STATUTORY, OR OTHERWISE, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, ACCURACY, OR CONTINUOUS AVAILABILITY. \nWE DO NOT GUARANTEE THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE ERROR-FREE, SECURE, UNINTERRUPTED, OR FREE OF DISRUPTIONS. YOU ASSUME FULL RISK FOR ANY RELIANCE UPON OR USE OF THE SERVICE.\n\n7. ABSOLUTE LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nTO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL STAYTUP, ITS CREATORS, DEVELOPERS, CONTRIBUTORS, LICENSORS, OR HOSTING PROVIDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES (INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, GOODWILL, WORK STOPPAGE, SYSTEM FAILURE, OR EQUIPMENT MALFUNCTION) ARISING FROM OR CONNECTED TO YOUR ACCESS TO, USE OF, OR INABILITY TO USE THE APP, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. \nIN NO EVENT SHALL OUR TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY TO YOU EXCEED ZERO DOLLARS ($0.00).\n\n8. INDEMNIFICATION\nYou agree to defend, indemnify, and hold completely harmless Staytup, its developers, operators, and affiliates against any and all claims, liabilities, losses, damages, expenses, and reasonable legal fees arising out of or related to:\n(i) Your violation of these Terms;\n(ii) Your improper use or misuse of the Service;\n(iii) Your infringement of any intellectual property, privacy, or third-party rights.\n\n9. MODIFICATIONS TO THE SERVICE AND TERMS\nWe reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any feature or part of Staytup at any time without notice. We may update these Terms periodically. Continued use of the App following any updates signifies your binding acceptance of the revised Terms.\n\n10. CONTACT INFORMATION\nFor legal inquiries, copyright notices, or questions regarding these Terms:\nEmail: info.to.animikh@gmail.com",n="STAYTUP \u2014 PRIVACY POLICY\n\nLast Updated: September 12, 2026 (September 2026)\n\nStaytup (\"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") is committed to safeguarding your personal privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how your information is gathered, utilized, stored, and protected when you access or use the Staytup web and mobile application.\n\n1. FUNDAMENTAL PRINCIPLE: WE DO NOT SELL YOUR DATA\nStaytup will NEVER sell, rent, monetize, trade, or transfer your personal data, listening habits, or account records to third-party advertisers, data brokers, or commercial marketing consortiums.\n\n2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT\nWe collect only the minimal data strictly required to deliver a seamless, personalized music streaming experience:\n\u2022 Account Information: When you sign in via Google OAuth or Firebase Authentication, we receive your basic authentication profile (unique Firebase UID, display name, registered email address, and profile picture avatar).\n\u2022 User-Created Content: Playlists you create, tracks marked as Liked/Favorites, custom playlist folders, and custom playlist covers.\n\u2022 Listening & Interaction History: Song play counts, recently played tracks, and search queries, used exclusively to power personal recommendations, listening statistics, and library management.\n\u2022 Social & Presence Data: When using collaborative features (such as Listening Party or live listening status), your active playback state (track title, artist, playback timestamp) and emoji reaction bursts are broadcast in real time to connected peers.\n\u2022 Technical & Device Telemetry: Anonymous client platform identifiers (e.g. browser type, operating system family, hardware classification) used solely for responsive UI rendering and active session device management.\n\n3. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION\nYour information is processed exclusively for the following operational and educational purposes:\n\u2022 Authenticating your identity and safeguarding your account against unauthorized access;\n\u2022 Synchronizing your playlists, liked tracks, and library across multiple devices;\n\u2022 Calculating personal listening statistics (e.g., hours listened, favorite artists);\n\u2022 Facilitating real-time synchronized listening in Party rooms;\n\u2022 Maintaining application stability, debugging technical issues, and preventing service abuse.\n\n4. DATA STORAGE, SECURITY & ENCRYPTION\n\u2022 All data transmission between your device and our systems utilizes modern TLS/HTTPS encryption protocols.\n\u2022 Authentication tokens and user database entries are securely hosted on Google Cloud infrastructure (Firebase Authentication and Firebase Realtime Database).\n\u2022 Offline songs and media streams are stored strictly in your local browser Cache API (\"staytup-offline-audio-v1\") on your personal device and are never uploaded to any remote server.\n\n5. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES & APIS\nTo deliver core functionality, Staytup interfaces with reputable third-party services:\n\u2022 Firebase & Google Cloud: Account identity verification, realtime data synchronization, and hosting infrastructure.\n\u2022 YouTube Services: Media streaming and catalog discovery. Your use of stream content is subject to the Google Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy).\n\u2022 LRCLIB: Retrieval of open-source synchronized and static lyrics.\nStaytup is not responsible for the privacy practices of independent third-party services linked from or embedded within the App.\n\n6. COOKIES AND LOCAL STORAGE\nStaytup utilizes local browser storage (localStorage, sessionStorage, and IndexedDB) solely for necessary operational mechanisms, including remembering your login session, preserving audio quality settings, caching offline tracks, and saving UI preferences. We do not use cross-site tracking cookies or advertising pixels.\n\n7. YOUR DATA RIGHTS & CONTROL\nYou maintain complete control over your data:\n\u2022 Profile Updates: You may edit your username, display name, and avatar at any time via Profile > Edit Profile.\n\u2022 Library Management: You may remove liked songs, delete playlists, or export a complete JSON backup of your playlists at any time.\n\u2022 Data Deletion: You may request complete deletion of your account and all associated listening history by contacting us at info.to.animikh@gmail.com. All associated records will be permanently erased within 30 days.\n\n8. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY\nStaytup does not knowingly solicit or collect personally identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that a child has provided us with personal information without parental consent, please notify us immediately, and we will take prompt steps to remove such data.\n\n9. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY\nWe may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected with an updated \"Last Updated\" date. Continued usage of Staytup signifies your acceptance of the updated terms.\n\n10. CONTACT US\nFor privacy-related inquiries, data erasure requests, or concerns:\nEmail: info.to.animikh@gmail.com",o="STAYTUP \u2014 DISCLAIMER & LICENSE\n\nLast Updated: September 12, 2026 (September 2026)\n\n1. CORE EDUCATIONAL & PERSONAL USE DECLARATION\nStaytup is developed for personal and educational music streaming purposes. All audio copyrights belong to their respective artists and record labels.\n\n2. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & COPYRIGHT DISCLAIMER\n\u2022 All musical recordings, audio streams, album artwork, artist likenesses, trademarks, brand names, and lyrics displayed or streamed through Staytup are the exclusive intellectual property of their respective copyright holders, recording artists, record labels, and publishers.\n\u2022 Staytup is an independent, non-commercial software project created strictly for personal listening utility, technical research, and educational demonstration of modern progressive web app capabilities, Web Audio API, and real-time synchronization.\n\u2022 Staytup does not claim, assert, or imply any copyright, ownership, licensing affiliation, or commercial authorization over any third-party audio, video, artwork, or lyrics accessible through the application.\n\n3. NON-HOSTING & INTERMEDIARY TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE\n\u2022 Staytup DOES NOT operate a media storage server, repository, or distribution warehouse.\n\u2022 The App does not host, store, replicate, or re-encode proprietary audio files on our servers.\n\u2022 Media streams and metadata are dynamically indexed and loaded on-the-fly from publicly accessible third-party APIs and public content sources (including YouTube and open metadata providers).\n\u2022 All media streaming conforms strictly to client-side delivery standards without server-side copyright infringement.\n\n4. NON-AFFILIATION & TRADEMARK NOTICE\n\u2022 Staytup is NOT affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by, authorized by, or in any way associated with Google LLC, YouTube, Spotify AB, Apple Inc., JioSaavn, or any of their parent corporations, subsidiaries, or affiliates.\n\u2022 All product names, logos, brands, and registered trademarks mentioned within the App are the property of their respective owners. Their reference is made solely for descriptive, nominative, and educational identification purposes.\n\n5. DMCA & COPYRIGHT COMPLIANCE POLICY\nStaytup honors intellectual property rights and adheres to the principles of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA).\nIf any copyright owner or licensed representative objects to the referencing or streaming of their content through Staytup, we will gladly and expeditiously honor your request.\nPlease send a formal notice of infringement to:\nEmail: info.to.animikh@gmail.com\nUpon receipt of a valid verification, the requested track, artist reference, or stream link will be permanently blacklisted and removed from our catalog within 24 to 48 hours.\n\n6. THIRD-PARTY ADVERTISEMENTS & EXTERNAL LINKS\nAny third-party notices, advertisements, or external links displayed within or alongside the application are served by automated third-party ad networks to help cover hosting costs. Staytup does not author, inspect, endorse, or assume responsibility for the accuracy, legality, or quality of any third-party products, services, or claims advertised.\n\n7. NO WARRANTIES & ABSOLUTE LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nStaytup is distributed strictly \"AS IS\" AND \"AS AVAILABLE\" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESSED OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR NONINFRINGEMENT.\nUNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL THE CREATORS, DEVELOPERS, OR CONTRIBUTORS OF STAYTUP BE HELD LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR LOSSES ARISING FROM THE USE, MISUSE, OR INABILITY TO USE THIS APPLICATION OR ANY CONTENT ACCESSED THROUGH IT.\n\n8. DEVELOPER & CONTACT\nFor licensing inquiries, copyright takedown notices, or general correspondence:\nDeveloper Contact: info.to.animikh@gmail.com\nWebsite: https://staytup.odireca.com"},706,[]);
